Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 09:32:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] test(routes): golden route inventory + owner-module
 invariant (Phase 0 safety net)

- TestGoldenRoutes snapshots all 219 registered endpoints against
  testdata/routes_golden.txt; refactor steps must keep it byte-identical
  (update intentionally via -update)
- TestEveryRouteHasOwnerModule asserts every endpoint belongs to exactly
  one module manifest - no orphan routes can be introduced
- TestPlatformModulesEndpoint covers the new public module-status API and
  the 404 gate behaviour end-to-end
